tical central axis, perfectly symmetrical horizontally with equal blank margins on the left and right sides. No shifting is allowed.\n[Detail Fidelity & Image Quality Standards] Strictly retain all original details: style, color tone, tailoring craftsmanship, garment length, fabric texture, prints, brand logos, trim decorations and footwear. Zero modifications to garment colors and overall silhouettes. Unified color temperature, white balance and exposure across the entire 2×2 grid. 8K resolution, photorealistic, highly detailed.", 1860973226, "randomize", "1:1", "2k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 39, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 40, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 41, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 42, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"wid